== banner state mapping
  OK   empty provider -> 未配置 banner
  OK   mock=true -> Mock banner
  OK   configured -> 已配置 banner names host
  OK   saved feedback shows timestamp
  OK   dirty feedback shows 未保存
  OK   key echo is length, not value
  OK   api key never echoed as text
  OK   empty key shows 尚未设置
